# p-drag-release (h11-p-drag): p-drag's drag and then the release: the url
# line p=3 (flushed at once), P's drop line gone, the slider thumb at rest.
# The cursor reads pan, not grab-hover: the drag moved P to plane (3, 9),
# above the view, so the pointer left P's 48 px box (the spec expected the
# open hand; the reference reads the crosshair).
# Behaviour (read on ref-h11 at c6754e7, WebKit/Chromium/Firefox alike):
# cursor pan; the p line 3; the url line p=3.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1038 290
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1088 290 over 160
wait 300
up
wait 600
shot p-drag-release
